# libretranslate
msgid "**CLI OIDC login (`bao login -method=oidc`, `http://localhost:8250/oidc/callback`) is out of scope.**"
msgstr "**Přihlášení CLI OIDC (`bao login -method=oidc`, `http://localhost:8250/oidc/callback`) je mimo rozsah.**"

