# libretranslate
msgid "**CSP** allows ``unsafe-inline``/``unsafe-eval`` for ``script-src-elem`` and ``blob:`` workers/images, required by Penpot’s SPA and worker-based renderer."
msgstr "**CSP** umožňuje ``unsafe-inline``/``unsafe-eval`` pro ``script-src-elem`` a ``blob:`` pracovníci / obrázky, vyžadované SPA Penpota a prezentantem na pracovišti."

# libretranslate
