msgid "**Native OIDC SSO:** Authenticate users against Keycloak via the ``oic-auth`` plugin, configured by JCasC at boot."
msgstr "**Původní OIDC SSO:** Autentizovat uživatele proti Keycloak prostřednictvím ``oic-auth`` plugin, nakonfigurován JCasC při startu."

# libretranslate
msgid "**Native OIDC SSO:** Authenticate users against Keycloak via the `oic-auth` plugin, configured by JCasC at boot."
