# libretranslate
msgid "**SSO authentication:** Access is protected by Keycloak via oauth2-proxy."
msgstr "**Ověření SSO:** Přístup je chráněn Keycloak via oauth2-Zástupce."

# libretranslate
msgid "**SSO flavor is `oauth2`** (oauth2-proxy sidecar → Keycloak), NOT native OIDC — because Checkmk Raw has no OIDC. The oauth2-proxy authenticates against Keycloak and passes `X-Remote-User`; Checkmk's site Apache trusts it via `auth_by_http_header`. This mirrors [`web-app-openproject`](../../roles/web-app-openproject/)'s header-SSO bridge (`OPENPROJECT_AUTH__SOURCE__SSO_HEADER` + LDAP-gated header trust)."
msgstr "**SSO chuť je `oauth2`** (oauth2-proxy sidecar → Keycloak), NENÍ NARODNÍ OIDC - protože Checkmk Raw nemá OIDC. Oauth2-proxy ověřuje proti Keycloak a projde `X-Remote-User`; Checkmk 's site Apache trust it via `auth_by_http_header`. Tato zrcadla [`web-app-openproject`](../../roles/web-app-openproject/)Hadder-SSO most (`OPENPROJECT_AUTH__SOURCE__SSO_HEADER` + LDAP- routed header trust)."

# libretranslate
msgid "**SSO round-trip test:** ``test-oidc-login.js`` drives ``/sso/key/generate`` through the Keycloak login form and asserts the UI no longer falls back to its own password gate."
msgstr "**SSO round-trip test:** ``test-oidc-login.js`` disky ``/sso/key/generate`` prostřednictvím Keycloak Přihlašovací formulář a tvrdí, že UI se již nevrací ke své vlastní heslo."

# libretranslate
msgid "**SSO round-trip test:** `test-oidc-login.js` drives `/sso/key/generate` through the Keycloak login form and asserts the UI no longer falls back to its own password gate."
