# libretranslate
#, python-brace-format
msgid "Cross-service probes (biber denied at prometheus, biber denied at matomo, dashboard tile reachability) are NOT part of the per-role biber persona. They live in the provider's own spec (`web-app-{prometheus,matomo,dashboard}/files/playwright/playwright.spec.js`), parameterised once over the provider's `<NAME>_TARGET_ROLES_JSON` manifest. For the dashboard, the parameterised scenario delegates to `web-app-dashboard/files/playwright/dashboard-card-flow.js::runDashboardCardScenario(page, context, target)`, which owns the tile visibility / iframe-embed / \"Tab\" pop-out assertions in one SPOT."
msgstr "Cross- servisní sondy (Biber zamítnut v Prometheus, biber zamítnut v Matomo, palubní deska dlaždice reachability) nejsou součástí per- role biber persona. Žijí ve vlastním spektrometru poskytovatele (`web-app-{prometheus,matomo,dashboard}/files/playwright/playwright.spec.js`), parametrizované jednou nad poskytovatelem `<NAME>_TARGET_ROLES_JSON` Projev. Pro palubní desku, parametrizovaný scénář deleguje na `web-app-dashboard/files/playwright/dashboard-card-flow.js::runDashboardCardScenario(page, context, target)`, který vlastní viditelnost dlaždic / iframed- embed / \"Tab\" Vyhodit tvrzení v jednom kole."

# libretranslate
msgid "Cross-service probes are NOT part of the per-role administrator persona. Dashboard tile reachability is owned by `web-app-dashboard/files/playwright/playwright.spec.js`, which delegates the per-target body to the `runDashboardCardScenario` helper in `dashboard-card-flow.js` (tile visible → click loads in `#main iframe` → header \"Tab\" button pops the embed into a fresh browser tab). That helper is the SPOT for dashboard-tile mechanics; consumer specs MUST NOT reimplement any of those assertions. Prometheus admin-reach and scrape parity are owned by `web-app-prometheus/files/playwright/playwright.spec.js`. Matomo admin-reach and tracker presence are owned by `web-app-matomo/files/playwright/playwright.spec.js`. Each provider parameterises the assertion over its `<NAME>_TARGET_ROLES_JSON` manifest."
msgstr "Cross-service sondy NEJSOU součástí per- role administrátora persona. Přístrojová deska dlaždice reachability je ve vlastnictví `web-app-dashboard/files/playwright/playwright.spec.js`, který deleguje per- cílové tělo na `runDashboardCardScenario` helper in `dashboard-card-flow.js` (dlaždice viditelné → klepněte na tlačítko zatížení v `#main iframe` → záhlaví \"Tab\" tlačítko otevře vložené do nové karty prohlížeče). Tento pomocník je STOT pro mechanika přístrojových obkládaček; spotřebitelské specifikace NEMUSÍ znovu implementovat žádné z těchto tvrzení. Prometheus admin- reach a scrap parity jsou vlastněny `web-app-prometheus/files/playwright/playwright.spec.js`. Matomo admin- dosah a tracker přítomnost jsou ve vlastnictví `web-app-matomo/files/playwright/playwright.spec.js`. Každý poskytovatel parafuje tvrzení nad jeho `<NAME>_TARGET_ROLES_JSON` Projev."

# libretranslate
msgid "Cross-service surface assertions (dashboard tile reachability, prometheus admin-reach and scrape parity, matomo admin-reach and tracker presence, biber-denied-at-prometheus, biber-denied-at-matomo) are owned by the provider's own spec. Each provider parameterises the assertion over its `<NAME>_TARGET_ROLES_JSON` manifest, rendered via `lookup('roles_with_service', '<svc>')`. Consumer roles' personas MUST NOT duplicate these probes."
msgstr "Povrchová tvrzení o příčném provozu (Přístrojová deska dlaždice reakhability, prometheus admin- reach and scrap parity, matomo admin- reach a tracker přítomnost, biber- depied- at- prometheus, biber- depied- at- matomo) jsou vlastněny vlastním spektrometrem poskytovatele. Každý poskytovatel parafuje tvrzení nad svým `<NAME>_TARGET_ROLES_JSON` manifest `lookup('roles_with_service', '<svc>')`. Osoby spotřebitelských rolí NESMÍ duplikovat tyto sondy."

