# libretranslate
msgid "GitHub Actions is GitHub's built-in CI/CD system. Each YAML file under `.github/workflows/` is one *workflow*; a workflow contains one or more *jobs*, and each job runs a sequence of *steps* on a hosted or self-hosted runner. Workflows are started by *triggers* declared in the `on:` section. The most common triggers in this repository are:"
