msgid "The workaround used here is the **GitLab OAuth2 provider** (``MM_GITLABSETTINGS_*``), which is generic enough to work with any OIDC-compatible identity provider including Keycloak. This provides true SSO: user accounts are automatically created in Mattermost on first login."
