# libretranslate
msgid "ejabberd's only HTTP surface is `ejabberd_web_admin` on `/admin` (see [`templates/configuration.yml.j2`](./templates/configuration.yml.j2)). It authenticates a bare JID against LDAP over HTTP Basic, so there is no Keycloak redirect to follow and no in-app logout control to click; client authentication itself runs over ports 5222/5269 and stays outside the Playwright loop, as noted under Watch Points. `acl.admin` additionally lists only the administrator JID, so the web admin refuses every other account outright. [`templates/playwright.env.j2`](./templates/playwright.env.j2) therefore declares `PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED=true` and `PERSONA_ADMINISTRATOR_BLOCKED=true`; the `guest` persona and the baseline reachability assertions run unconditionally."
msgstr "Jediným HTTP povrchem Ejabberdu je `ejabberd_web_admin` n `/admin` (viz [`templates/configuration.yml.j2`](./templates/configuration.yml.j2)). To ověřuje holý JID proti LDAP přes HTTP Basic, takže neexistuje žádný Keycloak přesměrování na sledování a žádné ovládání přihlášení k aplikaci kliknutím; autentizace klienta sama běží přes porty 5222/5269 a zůstane mimo smyčku Playwright, jak je uvedeno pod Watch Points. `acl.admin` navíc obsahuje pouze seznam administrátora JID, takže webová admin odmítá všechny ostatní účty přímo. [`templates/playwright.env.j2`](./templates/playwright.env.j2) proto prohlašuje `PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED=true` a `PERSONA_ADMINISTRATOR_BLOCKED=true`; `guest` persona a základní tvrzení reakční schopnosti jsou bezpodmínečně."

# libretranslate
msgid "ejabberd’s ``mod_admin`` HTTP UI is the only Playwright-testable surface; XMPP client login itself runs over 5222/5269 and MUST be exercised by an XMPP-aware client outside the Playwright test loop."
msgstr "Ejabberd 's ``mod_admin`` HTTP UI je jediný Playwright- testable povrch; XMPP klient přihlášení sám běží přes 5222/5269 a musí být vykonáván XMPP-vědomý klient mimo Playwright zkušební smyčku."

# libretranslate
msgid "ejabberd’s only HTTP surface is ``ejabberd_web_admin`` on ``/admin`` (see ```templates/configuration.yml.j2`` <./templates/configuration.yml.j2>`__). It authenticates a bare JID against LDAP over HTTP Basic, so there is no Keycloak redirect to follow and no in-app logout control to click; client authentication itself runs over ports 5222/5269 and stays outside the Playwright loop, as noted under Watch Points. ``acl.admin`` additionally lists only the administrator JID, so the web admin refuses every other account outright. ```templates/playwright.env.j2`` <./templates/playwright.env.j2>`__ therefore declares ``PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED=true`` and ``PERSONA_ADMINISTRATOR_BLOCKED=true``; the ``guest`` persona and the baseline reachability assertions run unconditionally."
msgstr "Jediným HTTP povrchem Ejabberdu je ``ejabberd_web_admin`` n ``/admin`` (viz ```templates/configuration.yml.j2`` <./templates/configuration.yml.j2>`__). It authenticates a bare JID against LDAP over HTTP Basic, so there is no Keycloak redirect to follow and no in-app logout control to click; client authentication itself runs over ports 5222/5269 and stays outside the Playwright loop, as noted under Watch Points. ``acl.admin`` additionally lists only the administrator JID, so the web admin refuses every other account outright. ```templates/playwright.env.j2`` <./templates/playwright.env.j2>`__ therefore declares ``PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED=true`` and ``PERSONA_ADMINISTRATOR_BLOCKED=true``; the ``guest`` persona a základní tvrzení reakční schopnosti jsou bezpodmínečně."

